    "description": "Title:\nHemingray 42 Aqua Blue Glass Insulator Glassware\nBrand:\nHemingray\nDepartment:\nAdults\nStyle:\nAntique\nColor:\nAqua Blue\nCategory:\nCollectibles & Art\nType:\nGlass Insulator\nCare Instructions:\nHand Wash Only\nCountry Of Origin:\nUnited States\nDesign:\nSmooth with Embossed Lettering\nFeatures:\nVintage, Embossed Lettering\nGlassware Type:\nInsulator\nMaterial:\nGlass\nModel:\n42\nMpn:\n42\nNumber Of Items In Set:\n1\nPattern:\nEmbossed\nSet Includes:\nGlass Insulator\nShape:\nDome\nTheme:\nIndustrial\nUnit Quantity:\n1\nUnit Type:\nUnit\nDescription:\nAdd a touch of historic charm to your decor or collection with this genuine Hemingray-42 glass insulator in striking aqua blue. Renowned for their iconic craftsmanship and durability, Hemingray insulators were essential on telephone and telegraph lines in the early-to-mid-20th century. This piece features beautiful embossed branding, a thick glass body, and a delightful beaded rim detail, making it both visually attractive and functional. Whether displayed as a standalone accent, repurposed for creative DIY projects, or included in a larger antique glass collection, this insulator offers lasting appeal and nostalgia. Own a slice of industrial history, manufactured in the USA and sure to impress both collectors and design enthusiasts alike. Buy confidently, knowing this is an authentic vintage piece, ideal for gifting or personal enjoyment.",
